OSPF routing - (Open Shortest Path First)
-Multi vendor dynamic routing
-implements dijstra Algorithm
-admisnitrative distance of 110
-advertised by area (area 0 is the back bone)

OSPF state : DOWN > INIT > TWO-WAY > EXCHANGE > LOADING > FULL


OSPF Router Roles Election : 
DR - designated router (master router)
BDR -backup designated router 
- (none or Drother) -router without special admin duty


ABR  Autonomous Boundary Router
ASBR Autonomous System Boundary Router 

OSPF LSA - Link State Advertisement Types 
Type 1 (Router LSA) - Advertising the "O"
Type 2 (Network LSA)- Advertised by DR (Designated Router)
Type 3 (Summary LSA )- Advertising the "O IA" route
Type 4 (ASBR Summary LSA) METRIC - Autonomous System Boundary Router - connect OSPF to another routing domain and perform route redistribution
Type 5 (AS external) -advertising "O E2"


